---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for BBK Marketing Solutions LLC."
  effectiveDate="March 11, 2026"
  updatedDate="March 11, 2026"
>
  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName} (&ldquo;BBK Marketing&rdquo;, &ldquo;Company&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;,
    or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information
    you may provide through our websites, advertising campaigns, lead forms, and marketing services.
  </p>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you
    interact with our services.
  </p>
  <p>
    By accessing our website or submitting information through our forms, you agree to the practices
    described in this Privacy Policy.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We may collect several types of information including:</p>
  <p><strong>Personal Information</strong></p>
  <p>Information that can identify you directly, including but not limited to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Full name</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Phone number</li>
    <li>City and State</li>
    <li>Business name (if applicable)</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Marketing Lead Information</strong></p>
  <p>When users submit information through advertising campaigns or marketing forms, we may collect information such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Responses to qualification questions</li>
    <li>Health-related eligibility questions for clinical research (if applicable)</li>
    <li>Demographic information</li>
    <li>Communication preferences</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Technical Data</strong></p>
  <p>When you visit our website, we may automatically collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>IP address</li>
    <li>Browser type</li>
    <li>Device type</li>
    <li>Pages visited</li>
    <li>Referral source</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This information is collected using cookies, analytics tools, and similar technologies.</p>

  <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>BBK Marketing Solutions may use the collected information for purposes including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Delivering marketing and advertising services</li>
    <li>Contacting potential clients or research participants</li>
    <li>Evaluating eligibility for clinical research studies</li>
    <li>Improving marketing campaigns and website functionality</li>
    <li>Responding to inquiries and support requests</li>
    <li>Complying with legal and regulatory obligations</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may also use aggregated and anonymized data for analytical and marketing optimization purposes.</p>

  <h2>4. Sharing of Information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell personal information.</p>
  <p>However, we may share information with:</p>
  <p><strong>Clients</strong></p>
  <p>
    If a user submits information related to a specific marketing campaign, that information may be
    shared with the client sponsoring the campaign (for example, a clinical research site, medical
    organization, or business client).
  </p>
  <p><strong>Service Providers</strong></p>
  <p>We may share information with trusted third-party providers such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Cloud hosting providers</li>
    <li>CRM platforms</li>
    <li>Email service providers</li>
    <li>Analytics providers</li>
    <li>Advertising platforms (such as Meta or Google)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers are required to maintain the confidentiality and security of the data.</p>
  <p><strong>Legal Compliance</strong></p>
  <p>We may disclose information when required by law, subpoena, or regulatory obligation.</p>

  <h2>5. Clinical Research Lead Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>Some campaigns managed by BBK Marketing Solutions may involve recruitment for clinical research studies.</p>
  <p>BBK Marketing Solutions does not conduct medical research and does not provide medical advice.</p>
  <p>We act solely as a marketing and lead generation provider for research organizations.</p>
  <p>Any medical screening, eligibility determination, or participation decisions are handled directly by the research institution.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
  <p>
    We implement reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards to protect personal
    information from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse.
  </p>
  <p>However, no electronic transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be 100% secure.</p>

  <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain collected information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this policy, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Campaign management</li>
    <li>Client reporting</li>
    <li>Legal or regulatory compliance</li>
  </ul>
  <p>After that period, data may be deleted or anonymized.</p>

  <h2>8. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
  <p>Our website may use cookies and similar tracking technologies to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Improve website performance</li>
    <li>Analyze traffic patterns</li>
    <li>Optimize marketing campaigns</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Users may choose to disable cookies through their browser settings.</p>

  <h2>9. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Request access to your personal data</li>
    <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
    <li>Request deletion of personal data</li>
    <li>Request limitation of data processing</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Requests may be submitted to: <a href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a></p>

  <h2>10. Third-Party Websites</h2>
  <p>Our services may contain links to third-party websites or platforms.</p>
  <p>{site.legalName} is not responsible for the privacy practices of those third-party services.</p>
  <p>Users should review their respective privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>11. Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our services are not directed to individuals under the age of 18.</p>
  <p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors.</p>
  <p>If such information is identified, it will be removed promptly.</p>

  <h2>12. Updates to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically.</p>
  <p>When updates occur, the &ldquo;Last Updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page will be revised.</p>
  <p>Users are encouraged to review this policy regularly.</p>

  <h2>13. Contact Information</h2>
  <p>If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, you may contact us:</p>
  <p>
    {site.legalName}<br />
    {site.address}<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a><br />
    Phone: <a href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
